，怨深禍大，不宜答和，此用心於小，末留意於大者也。試爲陛下論其輕重，及其大小。陛下若抑威損忿，暫省瑾言者，計可立決，不復咨之於群後也。陛下以關羽之親何如先帝?荊州大小孰與海內？俱應仇疾，誰當先後？若審此數，易於反掌。\"時或言瑾別遣親人與備相聞，權曰：\"孤與子瑜有死生不易之誓，子瑜之不負孤，猶孤之不負子瑜也。\"黃武元年，遷左將軍，督公安，假節，封宛陵侯。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhugejin-complete:line070:m0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"關羽","kind":"person","person_id":"1c2_03c_9ea","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhugejin-complete:line070:m0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"呂蒙","kind":"person","person_id":"ibt_i7u_ykp","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhugejin-complete:line070:m0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"劉備","kind":"person","person_id":"5f2_396_25c","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhugejin-complete:line070:m0040","start":40,"end":41,"surface":"瑾","kind":"person","person_id":"lpo_z63_vzb","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhugejin-complete:line070:m0042","start":42,"end":43,"surface":"備","kind":"person","person_id":"5f2_396_25c","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhugejin-complete:line070:m0070","start":70,"end":72,"surface":"關羽","kind":"person","person_id":"1c2_03c_9ea","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhugejin-complete:line070:m0121","start":121,"end":122,"surface":"瑾","kind":"person","person_id":"lpo_z63_vzb","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhugejin-complete:line070:m0142","start":142,"end":144,"surface":"關羽","kind":"person","person_id":"1c2_03c_9ea","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhugejin-complete:line070:m0184","start":184,"end":185,"surface":"瑾","kind":"person","person_id":"lpo_z63_vzb","s